            0.68
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "12 Medical Decisions"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.214,
            0.692,
            0.784,
            0.753
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Your ankle hurts. The doctor thinks there might be a bone chip in there (P = 0.3). If there is a bone chip and it’s not removed, you’ll have major pain for a long time (U = -100). If you have surgery, whether or not there was a chip to be removed, you’ll have moderate pain for a short time (U = -10)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.238,
            0.753,
            0.642,
            0.768
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Should you have the surgery? (Draw the decision tree.)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.214,
            0.769,
            0.784,
            0.798
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What would be the expected value of perfect information about whether you have a bone chip?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.214,
            0.799,
            0.784,
            0.83
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The doctor has been practicing a new laparascopic technique that will give much better information about the presence or absence of bone chips. It will"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.494,
            0.877,
            0.505,
            0.889
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 5,
