            0.214,
            0.159,
            0.784,
            0.19
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "be a bit annoying and uncomfortable "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "( \\mathrm { U }   =   - 2 )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " It will come out positive or negative with P(positive|bone chip) = x and P(positive|¬bone chip) = y."
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.214,
            0.189,
            0.784,
            0.22
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "For what values of x and y would it be worthwhile having the laparascopic test done? (Draw and evaluate the appropriate decision tree.)"
            }
