            0.567
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. What’s the danger of estimating "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "P ( A | B ) = { \\frac { \\# { \\mathrm { ~ o f ~ o c c u r e n c e s ~ o f ~ A ~ \\& ~ B ~ t o g e t h e r } } } { \\# { \\mathrm { ~ o f ~ o c c u r e n c e s ~ o f ~ B ~ } } } } ?"
